  Question 3: What is ring allreduce over n GPUs sending S bytes?
                                                                 
  This deserves a concrete breakdown for each parallelism type in your cluster.
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  The physical operation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Ring AllReduce with n participants each holding a tensor of S bytes:                                                                                                                                                                                             
                  
  Step 1 — Reduce-scatter:  n-1 rounds, each GPU sends S/n bytes to its right neighbour                                                                                                                                                                            
                            and accumulates what it receives from the left.                                                                                                                                                                                        
                            After this each GPU has 1/n of the final sum.                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Step 2 — AllGather:       n-1 rounds, each GPU broadcasts its chunk around the ring.                                                                                                                                                                             
                            After this every GPU has the full final sum.                                                                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Total bytes sent per GPU: 2 × (n-1)/n × S                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
  Total time:               2 × (n-1)/n × (α + β × S)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  For small n:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
   
  ┌─────┬──────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  │  n  │    Factor    │                Meaning                 │
  ├─────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ 2   │ 2×(1/2)=1.0  │ One full send+recv cycle — just a swap │
  ├─────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ 4   │ 2×(3/4)=1.5  │ 50% more overhead than a single send   │                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  ├─────┼──────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  │ 8   │ 2×(7/8)=1.75 │ Approaches 2× for large n              │                                                                                                                                                                                                  
  └─────┴──────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┘                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                  
  Applied to each comm type in your cluster                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                  
  TP AllReduce (in Megatron-style TP, 2 per block):                                                                                                                                                                                                                
                  
  n = tp = 2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       
  S = B × seq × hidden × 4 bytes = 2 × 64 × 256 × 4 = 131,072 bytes (128 KB)
  α, β = intra-node values   (TP groups are always within one node)                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  T_tp_one_allreduce = 2×(1/2) × (α_intra + β_intra × 131072)                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                     = 1.0 × (5µs + 1ns/B × 128KB)                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                     = 5µs + 131µs = ~136µs                                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Per block: 2 × 136µs = 272µs                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
  4 layers / 2 stages = 2 blocks per stage                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
  T_tp_total = 2 × 272µs = 544µs                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  DP AllReduce (gradient sync after backward):                                                                                                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  n = dp = 2      
  S = param_bytes per GPU = total_params / pp / tp
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    total_params ≈ layers × (12 × hidden²)     (standard transformer param count)                                                                                                                                                                                  
                 = 4 × 12 × 256² = 3,145,728 bytes ≈ 3 MB                                                                                                                                                                                                          
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
    per GPU = 3MB / pp / tp = 3MB / 2 / 2 = 768 KB                                                                                                                                                                                                                 
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  α, β = cross-node values   (DP groups span different nodes)                                                                                                                                                                                                      
                  
  T_dp_allreduce = 1.0 × (80µs + 80ns/B × 786432)                                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                = 80µs + 62,915µs ≈ 63ms
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  BUT: this is almost fully overlapped with the backward pass (~4ms compute).                                                                                                                                                                                      
  Effective: T_dp_effective = 0.3 × 63ms ≈ 19ms                                                                                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  ← This is actually the bottleneck for large models on Ethernet!                                                                                                                                                                                                  
   
  PP P2P (not AllReduce — just one directional send):                                                                                                                                                                                                              
                  
  n = not applicable — point-to-point only                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
  S = B × seq × hidden × 4 = 128 KB   (activation at stage boundary)                                                                                                                                                                                               
  α, β = cross-node values                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  T_p2p = α_cross + β_cross × 131072                                                                                                                                                                                                                               
         = 80µs + 80ns/B × 128KB
         = 80µs + 10,486µs ≈ 10.5ms per microbatch send                                                                                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Per step (pp-1=1 unpipelined sends):                                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  T_pp_p2p = 1 × 10.5ms = 10.5ms                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
  Putting it together for your test config                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
   
  ┌───────────┬─────────────────┬────────────────────┐                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │   Term    │ pp=2,tp=2,dp=2  │   pp=4,tp=2,dp=1   │
  ├───────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │ T_compute │ 2×1ms/2 = 1ms   │ 1×1ms/2 = 0.5ms    │
  ├───────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────────┤
  │ T_bubble  │ 1/2×1ms = 0.5ms │ 3/2×0.5ms = 0.75ms │                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  ├───────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │ T_tp_comm │ 544µs intra     │ 272µs intra        │                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  ├───────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │ T_pp_p2p  │ 1×10.5ms cross  │ 3×10.5ms cross     │
  ├───────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │ T_dp_comm │ ~19ms cross     │ 0 (dp=1)           │
  ├───────────┼─────────────────┼────────────────────┤                                                                                                                                                                                                             
  │ Total     │ ~31ms           │ ~33ms              │
  └───────────┴─────────────────┴────────────────────┘                                                                                                                                                                                                             
                  
  For this tiny test model the DP gradient sync (19ms) dominates because S=768KB over 100 GbE is slow relative to compute. With a real large model (billions of parameters), compute dominates instead and the relative costs shift significantly.                 
   
  This is exactly why the cost model must be parameterized — the "best" plan changes as the model grows. The planner finds the crossover point automatically.     